<title>THAILAND: Bangkok Bank raises fixed deposit rates.</title>
<headline>Bangkok Bank raises fixed deposit rates.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's largest bank, Bangkok Bank Plc, said on Thursday that the bank had raised its fixed deposit rates by at least 75 basis points effective July 16.</p>
<p>After the hike, the bank's fixed deposit rates would range between 8.75 and 11.75 percent compared with the previous range of 8.00-9.25, the bank said.</p>
<p>The deposit rates on non-resident and saving accounts remained unchanged at 6.50 and 5.00 percent respectively, it added.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
